    "updated_at": "2020-10-06T07:53:56Z",
    "body": "I think this is similar to #1713, if you make the following change to your config I think this should fix your issues\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n-format = '[\\[$all_status$ahead_behind \\]]($style) '\r\n+format = '([\\[$all_status$ahead_behind \\]]($style) )'\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think there is a mismatch between the docs and what the default format string actually is, so we need to fix that.",
